STEP 6 — Frontend (React + Vite)

What I did:
- Scaffolded a React project with Vite inside the frontend/ folder, using
  the JavaScript "react" template (not TypeScript).
    command used: npm create vite@latest frontend -- --template react
- Installed the frontend dependencies:
    command used: npm install   (run inside frontend/)

Verified:
- Node version: v22.14.0
- npm version:  10.9.2
- react:        19.3.1
- react-dom:    19.3.1
- vite:         8.3.4

Key files (created by Vite, left unmodified):
    frontend/index.html         -> page entry
    frontend/src/main.jsx        -> boots the React app
    frontend/src/App.jsx         -> root component
    frontend/vite.config.js      -> Vite config
    frontend/package.json        -> scripts and dependencies

Useful commands (run inside frontend/):
    npm run dev     -> start development server
    npm run build   -> build for production
